                      (     ../cludiv.as):00080         
                      (     ../cludiv.as):00081         * shift the divisor left
0062 4F               (     ../cludiv.as):00082                             clra                ; clear A
0063 6D62             (     ../cludiv.as):00083                             tst       2,s       ; test stack-relative value 2,s and update condition codes
0065 2B0B             (     ../cludiv.as):00084                             bmi       div51     ; branch if minus to div51
0067                  (     ../cludiv.as):00085         div5
0067 4C               (     ../cludiv.as):00086                             inca                ; increment A
0068 6865             (     ../cludiv.as):00087                             asl       5,s       ; shift stack-relative value 5,s left by one bit
